Subject: [PATCH] feat: organize elf payloads into dedicated subdirectory

---
 payloads/{ => elf}/ftpsrv-ps5.elf  | Bin
 payloads/{ => elf}/kstuff.elf      | Bin
 payloads/{ => elf}/notify.elf      | Bin
 payloads/{ => elf}/shadowmount.elf | Bin
 payloads/{ => elf}/websrv-ps5.elf  | Bin
 server.py                          |  23 +++++++++++++++++++----
 6 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 rename payloads/{ => elf}/ftpsrv-ps5.elf (100%)
 rename payloads/{ => elf}/kstuff.elf (100%)
 rename payloads/{ => elf}/notify.elf (100%)
 rename payloads/{ => elf}/shadowmount.elf (100%)
 rename payloads/{ => elf}/websrv-ps5.elf (100%)

diff --git a/payloads/ftpsrv-ps5.elf b/payloads/elf/ftpsrv-ps5.elf
similarity index 100%
rename from payloads/ftpsrv-ps5.elf
rename to payloads/elf/ftpsrv-ps5.elf
diff --git a/payloads/kstuff.elf b/payloads/elf/kstuff.elf
similarity index 100%
rename from payloads/kstuff.elf
rename to payloads/elf/kstuff.elf
diff --git a/payloads/notify.elf b/payloads/elf/notify.elf
similarity index 100%
rename from payloads/notify.elf
rename to payloads/elf/notify.elf
diff --git a/payloads/shadowmount.elf b/payloads/elf/shadowmount.elf
similarity index 100%
